   "code": "void setup() {\n  pinMode(8, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(9, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(10, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  digitalWrite(8, HIGH);\n  digitalWrite(9, LOW);\n  digitalWrite(10, LOW);\n  delay(1000);\n  digitalWrite(8, LOW);\n  digitalWrite(9, HIGH);\n  digitalWrite(10, LOW);\n  delay(1000);\n  digitalWrite(8, LOW);\n  digitalWrite(9, LOW);\n  digitalWrite(10, HIGH);\n  delay(1000);\n}\n"
